1.3 "Non-Commercial Use" means use that is not directed toward or intended for
    commercial advantage or monetary compensation. Personal study, hobby
    projects, classroom and academic teaching, academic research that is not
    commissioned or sponsored by a commercial entity, and evaluation of the
