    license are Non-Commercial Use.

1.4 "Commercial Use" means any use that is not Non-Commercial Use, including:

    (a) use by or for a for-profit or non-profit business, organization,
        institution or government body in the operation of its activities,
        including purely internal use with no product or revenue attached;
    (b) incorporation into a product, service or internal tool that is sold,
        licensed, subscription-based, ad-supported, or used to deliver services
        to third parties;
    (c) use in paid consulting, contracting, development or support work;
    (d) use to provide a hosted, managed or software-as-a-service offering;
    (e) use in training, fine-tuning, benchmarking or evaluating a commercial
